## Import

{{ codefile "shell" "examples/resources/sapintegrationsuite_script_collection/import.sh" }}

The ID is `<package_id>/<script_collection_id>`. SAP returns no file, so setting `content` in
the configuration makes the first apply upload it as an in-place update. Leave `content` and
`content_hash` out to adopt a collection without uploading anything.

## Limitations

- **SAP:** the ID must be unique across the whole tenant, not only within the package.
- **Provider:** files up to 32 MiB from local disk; the bundle ID in the ZIP is not aligned.

